---
import FeatureRow from '../FeatureRow.astro';
import efficiency from '../../assets/home/why-efficiency.jpg';
import insights from '../../assets/home/why-insights.png';
import coding from '../../assets/home/why-coding.png';
import workflows from '../../assets/home/why-workflows.jpg';
import integration from '../../assets/home/why-integration.jpg';
---

<section class="container-page py-14 lg:py-[4.6875rem]">
  <h2 class="text-display font-semibold">
    Why choose <span class="text-brand">CARE-E</span>
  </h2>

  <div class="mt-10 space-y-16 lg:mt-20 lg:space-y-[4.375rem]">
    <FeatureRow
      title="Increase Efficiency and Accuracy"
      image={efficiency}
      imageAlt="CARE-E encounter screen with condition, ICD codes and notes"
    >
      <p>
        CARE-E automates clinical documentation and administrative tasks, reducing clinician
        workload and freeing up time for more meaningful patient interactions. It also decreases
        after-hours “pajama time” spent on documentation. With advanced NLP and machine learning,
        CARE-E ensures high-quality documentation and accurate data capture, reducing billing errors
        and enhancing care delivery.
      </p>
    </FeatureRow>

    <FeatureRow
      title="Enhance Insights"
      image={insights}
      imageAlt="Two people chatting on a phone asking “Who is CareE Health?”"
      imageKind="illustration"
      imageWidth={508}
      reverse
    >
      <p>
        CARE-E offers a chat-like experience, enabling clinicians to quickly ask the platform
        patient-related questions, access chart insights, and identify gaps in care—supporting
        faster, more informed decision-making.
      </p>
    </FeatureRow>

    <FeatureRow
      title="Streamline Coding"
      image={coding}
      imageAlt="A person on a laptop reviewing CPT, ICD-9, ICD-10, DRG and HCPCS codes"
      imageKind="illustration"
      imageWidth={566}
    >
      <p>
        CARE-E automates medical coding, billing, and preventative care assessments to capture
        missed revenue, reduce documentation errors, and lighten administrative burdens. CARE-E
        provides:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 marker:text-xs">
        <li>
          <strong class="font-semibold">Billing &amp; Coding Automation</strong> – saves time and
          simplifies workflows.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="font-semibold">More Accurate Documentation</strong> – supports higher
          reimbursement rates.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="font-semibold">Less Time on Admin Tasks</strong> – reduces time spent on
          charting and paperwork.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </FeatureRow>

    <FeatureRow
      title="Enhanced Clinical Workflows"
      image={workflows}
      imageAlt="CARE-E encounter visit note with a body diagram for symptoms"
      reverse
    >
      <p>
        CARE-E simplifies and streamlines every stage of the patient encounter—before, during, and
        after—by providing a problem-focused medical chart and automating clinical notes with up to
        date past medical history (PMH), past surgical history (PSH), history of present illness
        (HPI), orders, treatment plans, and patient summaries for efficient, optimized workflows.
      </p>
    </FeatureRow>

    <FeatureRow
      title="Scalable Integration"
      image={integration}
      imageAlt="CARE-E sign-up panel over an EHR dashboard"
    >
      <p>
        CARE-E seamlessly integrates with existing EHRs, enhancing workflows without disrupting
        current systems. This flexible, scalable solution works within existing infrastructure—no
        need for a complete EHR overhaul.
      </p>
    </FeatureRow>
  </div>
</section>
